Subject: [PATCH 02/18] =?UTF-8?q?fix-jackpot-summary-mobile:=20=ED=94=84?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=EB=A1=9C=EA=B7=B8=EB=9E=98=EC=8B=9C=EB=B8=8C=20=EC=9A=94?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=EC=95=BD=20=EB=B0=94=20=EB=AA=A8=EB=B0=94=EC=9D=BC=20=EC=A4=84?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=EB=B0=94=EA=BF=88=20=EC=88=98=EC=A0=95?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
